Subject: [PATCH 02/17] test(umdr42 A1): frozen-gate thaw documentation for the
 closure window

UMDR42_CLOSURE_20261120_THAW_PATHS documents the three frozen files
touched by the P1 scope-authority repairs (scope/store.py, api/app.py,
workers/pentest_worker.py) in the established delta-mode convention;
byte-identity is restored by the closure refreeze. store.py postdates
the pre-unfreeze baseline, so the drift expectation uses the two-path
subset. Also fixes a duplicated comment line from the previous window.
